{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/08d419ae9a93d619461c42cd01453424.poster.avif?t=1763502245\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/08d419ae9a93d619461c42cd01453424.webm?t=1763502245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/08d419ae9a93d619461c42cd01453424.mp4?t=1763502245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Hextalia is a strategic tower defense set on a magical tabletop world, blending tactical path shaping with layered mechanics and meaningful choices. use the tools available to make the best build and adapt your board for upcoming challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/a689e425420f4141a21c107e3995f49b.poster.avif?t=1763502245\" width=1170 height=598 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/a689e425420f4141a21c107e3995f49b.webm?t=1763502245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/a689e425420f4141a21c107e3995f49b.mp4?t=1763502245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of adapting to preset paths, forge your own! Build walls to reshape enemy routes and turn the battlefield into your personal puzzle. Outsmart your foes with clever path manipulation and creative tactics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS COMBINATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With countless ways to craft and strategize, no two boards will ever play the same. Skill Tree. Gems. Runes. Relics. Towers. Walls. Piece them together to forge powerful synergies. experiment, adapt to shifting challenges, and break the meta in every game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The board strikes back. Enemies also evolve as you grow stronger, with special abilities and hard resistances that nullify damage from specific tower types. Adapt your loadout, shape new paths and turn their strengths against them or watch your defenses crumble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND YOUR FLOW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle into a living board game. Release shackled crystals and expand your collection, discover Gems and master Relics that change how every turn plays. Combine items, choose and upgrade towers, sculpt paths with walls and save Hextalia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br> </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734940?t=1763502245","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/20dfdac21a81de93a875159f4ae6ede8550373da/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763502245","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/3c4b0c69af1db2e81c92d46589fd17f9b8082c17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763502245","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/3c4b0c69af1db2e81c92d46589fd17f9b8082c17/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763502245","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4097360,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/08d419ae9a93d619461c42cd01453424.poster.avif?t=1763502245\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/08d419ae9a93d619461c42cd01453424.webm?t=1763502245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/08d419ae9a93d619461c42cd01453424.mp4?t=1763502245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Hextalia is a strategic tower defense set on a magical tabletop world, blending tactical path shaping with layered mechanics and meaningful choices. use the tools available to make the best build and adapt your board for upcoming challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/a689e425420f4141a21c107e3995f49b.poster.avif?t=1763502245\" width=1170 height=598 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/a689e425420f4141a21c107e3995f49b.webm?t=1763502245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/a689e425420f4141a21c107e3995f49b.mp4?t=1763502245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of adapting to preset paths, forge your own! Build walls to reshape enemy routes and turn the battlefield into your personal puzzle. Outsmart your foes with clever path manipulation and creative tactics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS COMBINATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With countless ways to craft and strategize, no two boards will ever play the same. Skill Tree. Gems. Runes. Relics. Towers. Walls. Piece them together to forge powerful synergies. experiment, adapt to shifting challenges, and break the meta in every game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The board strikes back. Enemies also evolve as you grow stronger, with special abilities and hard resistances that nullify damage from specific tower types. Adapt your loadout, shape new paths and turn their strengths against them or watch your defenses crumble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND YOUR FLOW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle into a living board game. Release shackled crystals and expand your collection, discover Gems and master Relics that change how every turn plays. Combine items, choose and upgrade towers, sculpt paths with walls and save Hextalia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br> </h2>","developers":["EpLap Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/ae7f75ce104c5e5382740f58e79ffd5aa40dd001/header.jpg?t=1763502245","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3734940/1365690602/311c79a56de2f6bf338bdc10acb12b7da54df31c/1760287280/dash_av